      {
        supported: true,
        description: "Propose to raise a figure's value (e.g. from 1 to 2 points). Other players in turn say Gut (concede) or Halten (hold). If all concede, bettor wins 1 point; if any hold, figure is contested for 2 points. You may only bet on a figure you have in hand.",
        cost: '0',
        constraints: 'Must have the figure in hand to bet (e.g. at least one heart to bet on Rot). After first card of last trick, cannot bet on Spiel unless you have a card of the suit led.',
